ATTRIBUTION
-----------

DynamicLens is built on lens measurements and research generously
published by other people. Please keep these credits intact, and name
them wherever you credit the plugin itself.

SOURCES.md records what each source contributed, and how it is used.

* tiedtke
  Real Cinema Lenses - real lens distortion grids shot on an ARRI Alexa
  Mini and converted to ST maps in Nuke. Every profile and texture under
  Content/Profiles/Tiedtke is derived from this pack.
  https://tiedtke.gumroad.com/l/realcinemalenses
  https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCVuRDikGULup2KloWP8qg-g
  These maps are numerically identical to Andy Davis's published
  creative lens maps; credit both. See SOURCES.md.

* Andy Davis (Imagery for Media)
  VFX RnD Lens Files - ARRI/Zeiss Master Prime and Zeiss Supreme
  distortion grids. The parametric profiles under Content/Profiles
  (AD_*) and the raw grids in Tools/data/raw are fitted from this data.
  His freely published creative lens maps supply the spherical ST-map
  profiles under Content/Profiles/AndyDavis (22 lens series, 110 primes).
  His published research also shaped the design of the plugin itself -
  the dynamic lens model, lens breathing, and the rules the ST-map path
  follows. SOURCES.md sets out what was taken from where.
  https://www.fab.com/sellers/Imagery%20for%20Media
  https://imag4media.com/
  https://imag4media.com/vfx-rnd/

* H. H. Nasse / Carl Zeiss Camera Lens Division
  "Depth of Field and Bokeh" (March 2010) - the optics behind the
  component's bokeh, cat's eye and vignette maths. Reference reading,
  not data. See SOURCES.md.


